   "html": "<sk-mc data-h=\"a53d744d\" data-id=\"mc-rc-tiefpass-003\" data-type=\"kprim\" data-difficulty=\"2\" data-topic=\"rc-tiefpass\" data-pin-last=\"false\">\n<div class=\"sk-stem\">\n<p>Beurteilen Sie für den RC-Tiefpass:</p>\n</div>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"A\" data-correct=\"true\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\nBei\n<sk-math data-tex=\"ZiA9IGZfXG1hdGhybXtnfQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\ngilt\n<sk-math data-tex=\"fFx1bmRlcmxpbmV7SH18ID0gMS9cc3FydHsyfQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p>Definition der Grenzfrequenz.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"B\" data-correct=\"true\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\nBei\n<sk-math data-tex=\"ZiA9IGZfXG1hdGhybXtnfQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\nbeträgt die Phase\n<sk-math data-tex=\"LTQ1XlxjaXJj\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p><sk-math data-tex=\"XGFyZ1x1bmRlcmxpbmV7SH0gPSAtXGFyY3RhbigxKQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"C\" data-correct=\"false\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\nFür\n<sk-math data-tex=\"ZiBcZ2cgZl9cbWF0aHJte2d9\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\nfällt\n<sk-math data-tex=\"fFx1bmRlcmxpbmV7SH18\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math> mit\n<sk-math data-tex=\"NDBcLFxtYXRocm17ZEJ9\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math> pro\nDekade.\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p>Erste Ordnung:\n<sk-math data-tex=\"MjBcLFxtYXRocm17ZEJ9\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math> pro\nDekade.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"D\" data-correct=\"false\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\nFür <sk-math data-tex=\"ZiBcdG8gMA==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math> gilt\n<sk-math data-tex=\"fFx1bmRlcmxpbmV7SH18IFx0byAw\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p>Der Gleichanteil wird durchgelassen:\n<sk-math data-tex=\"fFx1bmRlcmxpbmV7SH18IFx0byAx\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<div class=\"sk-explanation\" hidden>\n<p>Betrag und Phase folgen aus\n<sk-math data-tex=\"XHVuZGVybGluZXtIfSA9IDEvKDEgKyBcbWF0aHJte2p9IGYvZl9cbWF0aHJte2d9KQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.</p>\n</div>\n</sk-mc>"
